 loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Felix Dzerzhinsky</span><span class="tp">1877–1926</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/ferdinand-i-of-romania"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/ferdinand-i-of-romania.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Ferdinand I of Romania</span><span class="tp">1865–1927</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/guglielmo-marconi"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/guglielmo-marconi.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Guglielmo Marconi</span><span class="tp">1874–1937</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/abdullah-i-of-jordan"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/abdullah-i-of-jordan.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Abdullah I of Jordan</span><span class="tp">1882–1951</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
